{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fastrak : Metro is a game where you <i>drive trains on Australian railway lines!</i><br><br>The game places<i> you</i>\u00a0in control of trains on real Aussie railway lines! Drive on stylised recreations of suburban railway lines across Australia, in <strong>Perth</strong>, <strong>Melbourne</strong> and <strong>Sydney</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/21bbf307c9a67d5bb85d01b2a9b78278.avif?t=1772087256\" width=1560 height=416 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features the Suburban Lines:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Belgrave/Lillydale Line</strong> from Southern Cross to Box Hill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inner West Line</strong> from Central to Parramatta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fremantle Line</strong> from Perth to Fremantle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918220/extras/7b3fa4c053531daf913bdb64fda45c5f.avif?t=1772087256\" width=1560 height=416 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A huge fleet of rolling stock:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From P Class freight locos to 500 Series shinkansen, all kinds of trains are featured from across time and the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn, hard to master:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple simcade controls, but increasingly complex scenarios Fastrak : Metro won't leave you reading instruction manuals but instead finessing the brakes for a perfect stop, hitting speed targets, and trying not to topple passengers or the train!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918220?t=1772087256","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/